OL,5,G1700 Rise of the Nazis
OL,6,     FThe Home Front: Facing defeat on
OL,7,     Fthe Eastern Front, Hitler elects
OL,8,     Fto retreat to Germany - deep rifts
OL,9,     Femerge, his inner circle vies for
OL,10,     Fpower, and an enemy within plots
OL,11,     Fto kill Hitler.
